      "content": "It is brave to acknowledge that this feeling might be deeper than just a creative slump, and please consider that this sense of emptiness can sometimes require more support than a self-help break can offer. If your sense of self is tied to your output, it may be helpful to explore what you need to *feel alive* that is completely independent of your work. I strongly encourage you to speak with a mental health professional to help you navigate this profound feeling of meaning loss.",
